---

<Layout
  title="Sports Day | Icon School of Excellence"
  description="CCelebrate the spirit of sportsmanship at Icon School of Excellence Sports Day. Join us for an exciting day of athletic events, teamwork, and fun in Electronic City, Bangalore"
  keywords="Kannada Rajyotsava Bangalore, cultural events, Karnataka heritage, Icon School celebrations"
  robots="index, follow"
  canonical="https://iconschoolofexcellence.com/events/sports-day"
>
  <EventsList
    event_title="Sports Day"
    event_sub_title="Explore the latest photos from our Hands on Activity at ISOE"
    paragraph=`From December 9th to December 13th, Icon School of Excellence came alive with the spirit of competition and camaraderie during our Sports Week celebrations. The event kicked off with an exciting opening ceremony, setting the stage for a week filled with athleticism and teamwork.

Students participated enthusiastically in a wide array of sports and games, including track and field events, team sports, and fun activities that encouraged everyone to get involved. Each day brought thrilling moments, showcasing the skills, determination, and sportsmanship of our young athletes.

The week concluded with an energetic closing ceremony, where winners were awarded and participants celebrated for their efforts. Sports Week was a resounding success, leaving us with cherished memories and a deeper sense of community.`
    images={images}
  />
</Layout>
